    "Name": "Goliath GOL-1H",
    "Details": "An 80-ton Quad Mech, the Goliath entered production in 2652. Partially based on data from the earlier Scorpion Quad Mech, the Goliath carries a heavier payload of weapons and armor, intended to boost its effectiveness on the battlefield. Powered by a 320-rated Fusion Core, the Goliath GOL-1H is armed with a PPC and a pair of LRM-10’s. A pair of Machine Guns provide closer ranged firepower.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.12</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Goliath"
  },
